{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14233260","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14233260","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1423326001:1":{"text":"네. 황혼 버섯 숲 깊은 곳에 처음 갔을 때 정말 재미있었어요.","source_cn":"是的，第一次前往暮菌林地的深处，让我觉得很有趣。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CF53FFDD34758DD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423326002:1":{"text":"제가 서툴게 굴었지만 낚시도 배웠고, 지금까지 못 해본 경험을 많이 했어요.","source_cn":"虽然我一路上笨手笨脚的，但我学会了钓鱼，拥有了很多以前...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9491789CD779C84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423326003:1":{"text":"거기가 너무 좋아서... 다음에 또 기회가 된다면 가보고 싶어요.","source_cn":"我很喜欢那里呢……如果下次有机会的话，我还想……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FC4831097394F41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:欧罗娜":{"text":"오로나","source":"欧罗娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}